      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Safe mode is to protect you from trolls or attacks. It doesn't block your friends. Mirrors would only show your friends and grey robots if safe mode is active. I would still like to use mirrors like every other mirror dweller while safe mode is active. \n\nMaybe as an optional feature setting but i'm not sure how much sense it makes to have settings for a safe mode which should always be \"safe\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
